WEBVTT

00:03:31.249 --> 00:03:37.046
Now, foraging is the art/science
of identifying, collecting

00:03:37.088 --> 00:03:39.674
and eating wild food.

00:03:40.049 --> 00:03:46.055
So if anyone's ever convinced you
to try dandelions or wood sorrel,

00:03:46.097 --> 00:03:49.100
congratulations, you're a forager too.

00:03:50.351 --> 00:03:54.605
When my mom told me
that there was a bunch of free food

00:03:54.647 --> 00:03:57.775
hanging out in lawns and sidewalks ...

00:03:57.775 --> 00:03:59.360
(Laughter)

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:01.612
my mind was blown.